infographic sequence-funnel-simple
data
  title From error firehose to one page worth waking for
  desc Four discipline moves filter noise into a single trustworthy signal
  sequences
    - label Every captured error
      desc In-request + out-of-band; hundreds a day, each technically real
    - label Drop the safe trickle
      desc Alert on rate / SLO burn, not count
    - label Dedupe by fingerprint
      desc 10,000 identical crashes collapse to 1 new issue
    - label Log it, don't page it
      desc Handled 400s and known timeouts logged, never paged
    - label Gate by severity
      desc Only user-impacting SEV1 / SEV2 reaches a human
    - label One page worth waking for
      desc Channel quiet on noise, loud on the real outage
theme
  palette #f43f5e #f59e0b #14b8a6 #6366f1
